# Cargo.lock is committed: the perf guard builds base/current in fresh worktrees
# and otherwise re-resolves every dependency from crates.io, so the same commit
# measures different crate versions from one run to the next (a 30% swing was
# observed in the quantized batch TopK metric).
!Cargo.lock
